{# Labeler chat template for llama-server (port of the Ollama medgemma-labeler
   modelfile TEMPLATE, owner decision 2026-10-18: llama.cpp backend).

   Render rules, replicating what Ollama produced for the app's real
   payloads ([system, user] labeler calls; verified token-for-token against
   Ollama /api/generate context captures):
   - first user turn: "<start_of_turn>user" + system + "\n" + content
     (system only when non-empty; no newline after "user" - Ollama's Go
     template {{- trimmed it)
   - later user turns: "<start_of_turn>user" + content (glued)
   - assistant turns: "<start_of_turn>model\n" + content

   THINKING (byte-exact with Ollama): the suffix keeps the original closed
   "<think>\n\n</think>\n\n\n" block. The model briefly re-opens <think> in
   its output (a dozen-ish tokens before the answer - this is exactly what
   production did: Ollama's parser split the re-opened tags, the labeler's
   128-200 token budgets covered thinking + JSON). --reasoning-format
   deepseek performs the same split here; the guarded branches below signal
   think-capability to llama.cpp's probes (inputs the app never sends). A
   pre-opened think suffix was measured to make the labeler reason at essay
   length (700+ tokens, empty content at budget) - rejected 2026-10-18.

   The two guarded branches below serve llama.cpp's think-capability probes
   (a synthetic assistant message with reasoning_content; a render with
   enable_thinking=true) - inputs the app never sends - so every real
   request renders deterministically.

   Launch: llama-server --chat-template-file models/labeler.jinja
           --reasoning-format deepseek --alias medgemma-labeler #}
{%- set sys = '' -%}
{%- if messages[0]['role'] == 'system' -%}
  {%- set sys = messages[0]['content'] -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- set ns = namespace(first=true) -%}
{%- for message in messages -%}
  {%- if message['role'] == 'system' -%}
  {%- elif message['role'] == 'user' -%}
    {%- if ns.first and sys -%}
      {%- set ns.first = false -%}
      {{- '<start_of_turn>user' ~ sys ~ '\n' ~ message['content'] ~ '<end_of_turn>\n' -}}
    {%- else -%}
      {%- set ns.first = false -%}
      {{- '<start_of_turn>user' ~ message['content'] ~ '<end_of_turn>\n' -}}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- elif message['role'] == 'assistant' -%}
    {%- if message['reasoning_content'] is defined -%}
      {{- '<start_of_turn>model\n<think>' ~ message['reasoning_content'] ~ '</think>\n' ~ message['content'] ~ '<end_of_turn>\n' -}}
    {%- else -%}
      {{- '<start_of_turn>model\n' ~ message['content'] ~ '<end_of_turn>\n' -}}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- if add_generation_prompt -%}
  {{- '<start_of_turn>model\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n\n' -}}
{%- endif -%}
